# Walkthrough - Document and PDF Support

I have implemented support for processing PDF, DOCX, and plain text documents in the Lecture Video Analyser. The system now automatically detects document formats and extracts their content for AI analysis.

## Changes Made

### Core Services
- **[NEW] [document_processor.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/services/document_processor.py)**: Integrated `PyMuPDF` and `python-docx` to handle text extraction from PDF and DOCX files.
- **[NEW] [document.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/extractors/document.py)**: Created a new extractor that transforms document content into the internal [Segment](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/processing/models.py#56-92) format used by the AI pipeline.

### Processing Pipeline
- **[MODIFY] [worker.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/processing/worker.py)**: Updated the worker to auto-detect file types and dispatch documents to the [DocumentExtractor](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/extractors/document.py#8-99).
- **[MODIFY] [main.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/main.py)**: Updated the Telegram bot to accept PDF, DOCX, and text file uploads.
- **[MODIFY] [api/main.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/web/api/main.py)**: Updated the API endpoints to support document uploads.

## Verification Results

### Automated Tests
I ran a verification script [tests/test_document_processing.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/tests/test_document_processing.py) which confirmed:
1. [DocumentProcessor](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/services/document_processor.py#11-138) correctly extracts text from files.
2. [DocumentExtractor](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/lectvideoanalyser/src/extractors/document.py#8-99) structures document content into valid segments.
3. The integrated worker logic correctly identifies and processes documents.

```bash
PYTHONPATH=. python3 tests/test_document_processing.py
# Output:
# Created test file: tests/test_doc.txt
# Processed document type: text
# Extracted text: This is a test document for the lecture video anal...
# Extractor segments count: 1
# Extraction tests passed!
```

## How to use
- **Telegram Bot**: Simply send or forward a PDF, DOCX, or text file to the bot. It will be processed similarly to a video lecture.
- **Web Dashboard**: Upload documents via the existing upload interface. They will appear in the lecture list after processing.
